---
description: Shell vs page split and a11y for host chrome
globs: src/modules/shell/**/*.tsx,src/modules/**/pages/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# React shell

- Chrome (header, nav, toast, session menu) stays in `modules/shell`. Page modules own route screens.
- Preserve landmarks: banner, main, labelled nav, skip link.
- Do not use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`. Buttons need names; dialogs need titles.
- POS chrome cannot navigate to the full portal.
